{
  "Npcs.Necromancer.Desc": "Before you stands a towering monstrosity, a being of nightmares. The Necromancer, covered in a red cloak, breathes slowly, sure of its impending victory. Around him stands several bone piles, from which skeletons are assembled to attack you."
  "Npcs.Necromancer.Name": "Necromancer"
}
